# CSS Standards

## Layer order (do not change enqueue order)

1. `variables.css` — design tokens only
2. `common.css` — `.hotw-*` components and layout
3. `style.css` — page-specific overrides
4. `responsive.css` — breakpoint tweaks

## Tokens

Edit colors, fonts, spacing in `variables.css` only:

```css
:root {
  --hotw-forest: #1e392a;
  --hotw-orange: #ff6600;
  --font-display: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
}
```

Never hard-code hex in new component rules when a token exists.

## Component naming

BEM with `hotw-` prefix:

```css
.hotw-hero { }
.hotw-hero__title { }
.hotw-section--cream { }
```

## Responsive rules

**New breakpoint rules:** only inside existing `@media` blocks in `responsive.css`:
`1799px`, `1599px`, `1366px`, `1299px`, `1199px`, `991px`, `767px`, `599px`, `399px`.

Do **not** add new `@media` blocks to `common.css`.

## Prose / WYSIWYG

Wrap ACF rich text in `.hotw-prose` and style descendants globally.

## CF7 styling

Use `html_class="hotw-cf7"` on Contact Form 7 shortcodes.
